# T3 - Medio: vale pegar sempre; bom retorno por slot
Show
    BaseType "Maven's Chisel of Scarabs" "Grand Eldritch Ember" "Foulborn Regal Orb" "Maven's Chisel of Procurement" "Eldritch Exalted Orb" "Stacked Deck" "Orb of Unravelling" "Tainted Mythic Orb" "Tainted Chaos Orb" "Ancient Orb" "Memory of Reverence" "Tainted Orb of Fusing" "Exalted Orb" "Memory of Loneliness" "Tainted Armourer's Scrap" "Foulborn Orb of Augmentation" "Enkindling Orb" "Gemcutter's Prism" "Tainted Chromatic Orb"
    SetTextColor 255 245 210 255
    SetBorderColor 230 180 80 255
    SetBackgroundColor 55 35 0 225
    SetFontSize 40
    PlayAlertSound 4 210
    MinimapIcon 2 Yellow Star

# T4 - Baixo, mas util: craft/qualidade/mapas. Visivel e discreto.
Show
    BaseType "Orb of Scouring" "Grand Eldritch Ichor" "Orb of Intention" "Orb of Regret" "Blessed Orb" "Vaal Orb" "Orb of Alchemy" "Tainted Blacksmith's Whetstone" "Tainted Jeweller's Orb" "Glassblower's Bauble" "Instilling Orb" "Divine Vessel" "Orb of Fusing" "Lesser Eldritch Ichor" "Greater Eldritch Ichor" "Orb of Chance" "Orb of Unmaking" "Orb of Alteration" "Regal Orb" "Chromatic Orb" "Orb of Augmentation" "Greater Eldritch Ember" "Lesser Eldritch Ember" "Blacksmith's Whetstone" "Armourer's Scrap" "Orb of Binding" "Jeweller's Orb"
    SetTextColor 230 230 200 230
    SetBorderColor 180 150 80 190
    SetBackgroundColor 40 30 0 145
    SetFontSize 31
    MinimapIcon 2 Yellow Circle

# T5 - Muito baixo / muita pilha. Aparece minimo; sem som, para nao atrapalhar Breach.
